WEBVTT

27:03.315 --> 27:06.860
Yes, until my brother killed him.

27:08.945 --> 27:11.448
Life is full of these little ironies.

27:12.532 --> 27:15.202
My sister married the new king, and...

27:15.327 --> 27:17.787
my repulsive nephew
will be king after him.

27:20.540 --> 27:23.668
I must do my part for the honor of my house.
Wouldn't you agree?

27:25.503 --> 27:27.380
But how?

27:27.505 --> 27:30.258
Well, my brother has his sword
